In that background, this Court wanted FSL report dated 24.1.2024 which has now come and so far as the cloth of the victim girl is concerned, the result read as follows:
(i) blood has been detected over small areas in the exhibit marked 'A';
(ii) semen could not be detected in exhibit marked 'A';
(iii) serological report of origin and group of blood would follows.
7.

Further, so far as the blood that was found on the cloth, the examination read as follows:
(i) exhibit(s) marked "A";
(ii) nature of stains "Blood";
(iii) species of origin results Patna High Court CR. MISC. No.12075 of 2024(5)
dt.13-09-2024 "Human";
(iv) a.b.o. grouping result of Antigen "A" & Antigen "B" present.
